sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Pup as pup CLI
    participant MCP as MCP Server
    participant DD as Datadog API

    User->>Pup: pup mcp call security_findings_schema '{...}'
    Pup->>Pup: Connect (cached or fresh session)
    Pup->>MCP: POST tools/call<br/>{"name": "security_findings_schema",<br/> "arguments": {...}}
    MCP->>DD: Internal API call
    DD-->>MCP: Response data
    MCP-->>Pup: {content: [{type: "text", text: "..."}]}
    Pup->>Pup: Extract text from content blocks
    Pup->>User: Print response
